      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Despite the 9 to 5 tradition, the survey of downtown Manhattan workers finds that 8:30-4:30 is actually the most popular schedule with those who responded. Second is 8:45-4:45, and third are three schedules of about equal popularity: 8 to 4, 8:15-4:15, and 9 to 5.",
